        {
          "text": "Basi, akaondoka, akaenda Sarepta; hata alipofika langoni pa mji, kumbe! Mwanamke mjane alikuwako akiokota kuni; akamwita, akamwambia, Niletee, nakuomba, maji kidogo chomboni nipate kunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
