        {
          "text": "Naye akasema, Kama BWANA, Mungu wako, aishivyo, sina mkate, ila konzi ya unga katika pipa, na mafuta kidogo katika chupa; nami ninaokota kuni mbili ili niingie nijipikie nafsi yangu na mwanangu, tuule tukafe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
