        },
        {
          "text": "Akamwambia Eliya, Nina nini nawe, Ee mtu wa Mungu? Je! Umenijia ili dhambi yangu ikumbukwe, ukamwue mwanangu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
