              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamwambia, Nipe mwanao. Akamtoa katika kifua chake, akamchukua juu chumbani mle alimokaa mwenyewe, akamlaza kitandani pake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
